umber  and  right axillary contents   is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm aggregate of adipose within which multiple tan pink lymph nodes are identified ranging from 0 2cm to 5 0cm in greatest dimension  The largest lymph node has a tan white small cut surface with areas of necrosis and hemorrhage  Representative sections are submitted as follows  J N  Whole lymph nodes O P  Representative of the largest lymph node Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shave margin   is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm aggregate of fibrofatty breast tissue which is entirely submitted in cassettes Q T  Gross Description by  SHANNON SCHUTZ Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT  AXILLARY CONTENTS   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT   FINAL SHAVED MARGIN    EXC BIOPSY   report_end  , Negative.
