y fluid  At the 6 oclock aspect there is a lobulated  protruding  rubbery tan pink nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  The nodule comes to 0 5cm from the posterior margin  No additional discrete masses or lesions are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   representative sections  approximately 90  of the fibrotic area  to include anterior and posterior margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   three representative sections from the uninvolved parenchyma within the lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  representative sections of uninvolved parenchyma from the lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   entire protruding nodule to deep margin from the 6 oclock position  Gross Dictation by Jennifer Nash  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Negative.
