 the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  09 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 08 10 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  in three parts are the following   1   left axillary sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x d1 0cm lymph node  sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm well circumscribed tan white fleshy nodule within the parenchyma  The specimen is trisected and submitted entirely in A and B  Labeled  left breast   is a 5  x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue with a REMOVED_DATE x0 6cm overlying skin ellipse and a 2 9cm well healed linear scar  The specimen is oriented with a long suture indicating the lateral margin and a short suture indicating the superior margin  The specimen is sectioned medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm healing biopsy cavity with surrounding fibrosis and fat necrosis which extends 0 3cm from the deep resection margin  0 6cm from the medial resection margin  2 5cm from the lateral resection margin  0 4cm from the superior resection margin  and 0 3cm from the inferior resection margin  The biopsy cavity is present 0 8cm beneath the skin surface  No other lesions are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  C  biopsy cavity and deep margin D  biopsy cavity and superior margin E  biopsy cavity and inferior margin F  biopsy cavity and overlying skin G  representative section of biopsy cavity Labeled  left breast  new deep margin  stitch marks deep margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch orienting one surface  The stitch surface is inked black  the specimen is sectioned  and representative sections are submitted in cassettes H and I  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Alphonse Taghian  M D  Irene Kuter  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT  NEW DEEP MARGIN    report_end  , Negative.
