ble nipple areola complex  The posterior margin is inked black  and the anterior  blue  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm firm  ill defined stellate white lesion in the inferior and medial aspect of the specimen  0 6cm from the closest posterior margin  There is also a REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm defect on the anterior aspect of the breast  4 5cm lateral to the nipple  associated with an underlying cystic cavity measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm which abuts the anterior margin and is 0 3cm from the deep margin  Approximately 7 0cm superior and lateral to the cavity is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm stellate white pink fibrotic lesion  0 9cm from the closest deep margin  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cystic cavity in closet relationship to deep margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavity  including overlying skin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Stellate fibrotic lesion in lateral breast  including deep margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Nipple area with underlying normal appearing parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Normal appearing breast parenchyma at lateral portion of specimen   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tumor in inferior medial aspect of specimen with posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue adjacent to tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Scar abutting deep margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Ill defined fibrous area in anterior aspect  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  additional margin  superficial  left  are multiple fragments of soft tissue that are not oriented  measuring in aggregate  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm  The tissue is submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  in toto  Gross Dictation by Alton Brad Farris III M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Alton Brad Farris III M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Kristina Braaten M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE ADDEND